  "content": "<p>Sometimes the flu turns into maker time. One of our members spent his sick days modding his 3D printer to hold a pen and writing custom plotter software, with help from one of the latest AI models. It has presets for paper games and of course, proper Bavarian language support. Priorities.</p><p><a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/hackerspace\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>hackerspace</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/makerspace\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>makerspace</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/openworkshop\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>openworkshop</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/MunichMakerLab\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>MunichMakerLab</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/MuMaLab\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>MuMaLab</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/Kreativquartier\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>Kreativquartier</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/Kreativlabor\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>Kreativlabor</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/DIYMunich\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>DIYMunich</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/3dprinting\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>3dprinting</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/plotter\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>plotter</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/aitools\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>aitools</span></a></p>",
